   "text": "Saskatchewan Polytechnic - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nSaskatchewan Polytechnic\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nSaskatchewan Polytechnic serves students through applied learning opportunities on Treaty 4 and Treaty 6 Territories and the homeland of the Métis. Learning takes place at campuses in Moose Jaw, Prince Albert, Regina and Saskatoon and through extensive distance education opportunities. Programs serve every economic and public service sector. As a polytechnic, the organization provides the depth of learning appropriate to employer and student need, including certificate, diploma and degree programs, and apprenticeship training. Saskatchewan Polytechnic engages in applied research, drawing on faculty expertise to support innovation by employers, and providing students the opportunity to develop critical thinking skills.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 06:17\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n26/03/2026 06:17\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nCanada\nYearly Fees\nMax: CA$22,000.00\nMin: CA$16,000.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n19%\n1,136 of 5,981 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1959\nCampus(es)\nSaskatoon\nCountry\nCanada\nExcluded Countries\nIndia\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n01/12/2025\nContract End Date\n31/01/2030\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://spsa.ca/housingregistry/\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://saskpolytech.ca/about/applied-research-and-innovation/student-scholarships.aspx\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A-2daACVC-4\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ILfETetTc7w\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=g-By7Z8vp3g\nInternship Details\nhttps://saskpolytech.ca/about/applied-research-and-innovation/job-internships.aspx\nAdditional Information\nApplication Fee - CAD 150",
